{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913480/extras/a4455170ff0742d3c0fcef1e58ddc2df.poster.avif?t=1774276822\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913480/extras/a4455170ff0742d3c0fcef1e58ddc2df.webm?t=1774276822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913480/extras/a4455170ff0742d3c0fcef1e58ddc2df.mp4?t=1774276822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended. You don't know how. You don't even know who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking in a derelict hospital with no memories, your only clue is a photograph of a beautiful, androgynous stranger named Taylor. He doesn\u2019t know you, but circumstances soon bind your fates together. His desperate plan to create a vaccine needs your strength, and your journey to uncover the truth may depend on him\u00a0just\u00a0as\u00a0much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you are his shield, the muscle protecting a brilliant but guarded scientist. You are partners, allies against the dead that walk, forging a bond in the harsh light of a broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913480/extras/a3257df75e3476436dc0de1f846e3d67.avif?t=1774276822\" width=973 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But when night falls, everything changes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet darkness of your safe house, a different side of him surfaces. The guarded scientist disappears, replaced by a sweet, vulnerable, and shockingly affectionate soul who seeks you out for warmth and intimacy. His presence feels as real as the danger outside, pulling you into a secret world that seems to vanish with the morning sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now the keeper of a profound secret about the person you\u2019re sworn to protect, a secret they themselves are unaware of. Will you be a compassionate guardian of their fractured state? Or will you embrace a connection that feels more real than the waking world, whatever the\u00a0consequences?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913480/extras/65b5fbee8baece5314236e6408911f04.avif?t=1774276822\" width=973 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 A Story of Survival and Identity: </strong>Your past is a mystery, but your future will be defined by the choices you make and the person you reveal\u00a0yourself\u00a0to\u00a0be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Deep, Branching Narrative: </strong>Your actions matter. The way you treat Taylor, whether in the light of day or in the intimacy of night, will shape your relationship and lead to multiple, drastically different\u00a0endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Stand by His Side: </strong>Protect a brilliant but guarded scientist as he works toward a cure, forging a partnership that\u2019s tested daily by danger and\u00a0uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Intense Emotional Stakes:</strong> Grapple with a profound secret. Are you a loyal partner, a secret lover, or something much more complicated?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 A Unique Day/Night Cycle: </strong>Build a partnership with who he is in the light, and navigate a complex, secret intimacy with who he becomes\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He needs a hero. What 